ce Visit ---\nS: Jennifer Woods is here for follow-up of her breast cancer, stage III. She has been stable since her treatment began approximately 3.2 years ago.\nO: Her blood pressure was 130/79 mmHg, and her weight was 728 lb. Physical examination, including breast examination, showed no abnormalities.\nA: Cancer (see type table) - unchanged since the last visit, with no signs of recurrence.\nP: Continue with anastrozole 1 mg. We will reassess in 3-6 months.\n\n--- 09/01/2021 Office ---\nS: Jennifer Woods visited for a lab review following her breast cancer treatment. She reports feeling well with no new symptoms."
